  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/claudioemmanuel/squeez/zipball/v1.50.0",
  "body": "### Added\n- feat(gateway-sim): measure what an API-level gateway would add, read-only\n- feat(wrap): signal AI_AGENT to wrapped commands\n- feat(memory): session-start memory scoped to the repo, across hosts\n- feat(export): content-free team metrics as JSON or OTLP\n- feat(budget): advise before an expensive command in a nearly full window\n- feat(filters): installable filter-DSL packs with a test gate\n- feat(discover): suggest a filter-DSL rule from a weak command's output\n- feat(read): send a hunk, not the file, when a re-read changed little\n- feat(retrieve): learn from squeez_retrieve which handlers cut too much\n- feat(images): downscale oversized screenshots in MCP results\n- feat(receipt): squeez receipt prices what squeez saved\n- feat(setup): limit host registration with --host=a,b or SQUEEZ_HOSTS\n- feat(context): per-session context files for concurrent sessions\n- feat(hooks): host-contract canary for Claude Code hook payloads\n\n### Changed\n- docs: renew the README and update the repo guide for the new features\n- style(receipt): use is_multiple_of for digit grouping\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/claudioemmanuel/squeez/compare/v1.49.3...v1.50.0\n"
